    {
      "id": "FR-002",
      "title": "Completion admission fails closed unless at least one successful, completed execution exists for the exact merge SHA on the repository default branch with \u0060event=push\u0060; PR-head success, reachability, an empty or non-success-only matching run set, mismatched executions, and read failures never imply verification, while unrelated matching non-success runs cannot veto an existing qualifying success. (Stories: US-001, US-002; Acceptance: AC-001, AC-002, AC-003)",
      "text": "Completion admission fails closed unless at least one successful, completed execution exists for the exact merge SHA on the repository default branch with \u0060event=push\u0060; PR-head success, reachability, an empty or non-success-only matching run set, mismatched executions, and read failures never imply verification, while unrelated matching non-success runs cannot veto an existing qualifying success. (Stories: US-001, US-002; Acceptance: AC-001, AC-002, AC-003)",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        "AC-001",
        "AC-002",
        "AC-003"
      ],
      "priority": null,
      "classification": [],
      "source": "work/2905-post-merge-verification/spec.md",
