    {
      "id": "FR-003",
      "title": "The live delivery adapter reads post-merge execution evidence only after GitHub reports the PR merged, preserves the complete matching-run inventory so unrelated red/pending/cancelled diagnostics remain visible, applies qualifying-success precedence, and feeds the same typed fact to both the lifecycle reducer and completion writer. (Stories: US-001, US-002; Acceptance: AC-002, AC-003, AC-004)",
      "text": "The live delivery adapter reads post-merge execution evidence only after GitHub reports the PR merged, preserves the complete matching-run inventory so unrelated red/pending/cancelled diagnostics remain visible, applies qualifying-success precedence, and feeds the same typed fact to both the lifecycle reducer and completion writer. (Stories: US-001, US-002; Acceptance: AC-002, AC-003, AC-004)",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
