    {
      "id": "DEC-003",
      "title": "Bind the selected verification receipt into the completion receipt digest and verifier. An existing valid completion receipt remains replay authority for idempotent cleanup; new completion authority cannot be minted without exact-merge verification.",
      "decision": "Bind the selected verification receipt into the completion receipt digest and verifier. An existing valid completion receipt remains replay authority for idempotent cleanup; new completion authority cannot be minted without exact-merge verification.",
